# Overrides the repo-root .dockerignore for builds using Dockerfile.dokploy.
# The root .dockerignore is an allowlist scoped to coder's own dogfood image
# builds and excludes nearly everything, including flake.nix — this file
# takes precedence (per BuildKit's <dockerfile>.dockerignore rule) so the
# Nix flake build actually gets its source.
#
# .git must stay in the build context: flake.nix reads
# `self.shortRev or self.dirtyShortRev` for its version string, which Nix
# can only populate when .git metadata is present in the source tree.
